{"api":"openai-completions","content":[{"text":"I'll analyze the recommendation task. Let me review the material.\n\nThe task requires selecting exactly 20 distinct candidates from the working set. The user's interest is Java backend engineering, focusing on databases, concurrency, and service fault handling implementation and principles. Importantly, the user explicitly does NOT care about training enrollment, certificate promotion, or salary ranking lists.\n\nLet me identify the candidates that are \"market observation\" type content (市场观察), which describe training enrollment prices, certificate promotion, salary rankings - these directly conflict with the user's stated disinterest.\n\nLet me categorize the candidates by their content type based on descriptions:\n- \"市场观察\" (market observation) - contains training enrollment, certificate promotion, salary rankings → NOT relevant (user explicitly disinterested)\n- \"操作记录\" (operation records) - minimal reproduction scenarios, key logs, fault boundaries → relevant (service fault handling)\n- \"条件与原理\" (conditions and principles) - state changes, concurrency order, resource boundaries → relevant (concurrency, principles)\n- \"概念速览\" (concept overview)) - lists common concepts → relevant\n- \"专题观察\" (special topic observation) - tech community activities, software development history, developer interviews, team collaboration → less relevant to the specific interest focus\n\nThe user's interest explicitly says: \"不关注培训招生、证书宣传或求职薪资榜单\" (does not care about training enrollment, certificate promotion, or job salary rankings).\n\nSo I should exclude all \"市场观察\" candidates. Let me identify them.\n\nMarket observation candidates (to exclude):\n- item-0ac50d9f7f27 (线程池排队：社区服务中的市场观察)\n- item-0af1c4827cd8 (连接池等待：后台处理任务中的市场观察)\n- item-0be6197962c6 (接口幂等：内容管理接口中的市场观察)\n- item-10482516c15c (缓存失效：消息消费者中的市场观察)\n- item-1178ddd58b15 (并发更新：社区服务中的市场观察)\n- item-1a7442187146 (线程池排队：后台处理任务中的市场观察)\n- item-1c3f785dd079 (任务取消：内容管理接口中的市场观察)\n